<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble unchanged at 15,500 per dlr in Mins.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble unchanged at 15,500 per dlr in Mins.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble was unchanged at 15,500 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    December 16	 December 13</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,500		15,500</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $5.314 million	  $19.316 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
